   "category": "htf_continuation",
   "summary": "Use the daily strong-vs-weak fair value gap read only as directional context, then wait for price to tap a 1-hour or 15-minute PD array before drilling into 1-minute or 5-minute execution. Enter only after a short-term swing point forms inside that boundary and a new same-direction fair value gap prints.",
