    "setup_tf": "15m|1h",
    "entry_tf": "1m|5m",
    "strict": false,
    "notes": "Daily bias is descriptive only here: the presenter reads strong vs weak daily fair value gaps, but the actionable boundary tap happens on the 1-hour or 15-minute setup_tf and execution remains on the 1-minute or 5-minute entry_tf."
   },
